### Set-Specific Progress Tracking Tests
### Test the practice and test progress endpoints with set-aware logic

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@studentId = 1
@chapterId = LC5H0101
@subjectId = MATH

### ============================================
### PRACTICE PROGRESS TESTS
### ============================================

### Test 1: Get Practice Progress by Chapter
# Expected: Set-aware response with set1/set2 breakdowns
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Test 2: Get Practice Progress by Subject
# Expected: Set-aware response with set1/set2 breakdowns
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/subject?subjectId={{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### TEST PROGRESS TESTS
### ============================================

### Test 3: Get Test Progress by Chapter
# Expected: Set-aware response with set1/set2 breakdowns
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/testProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Test 4: Get Test Progress by Subject
# Expected: Set-aware response with set1/set2 breakdowns
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/testProgress/subject?subjectId={{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### SCENARIO TESTS
### ============================================

### Scenario 1: Set 1 Incomplete (Student with partial Set 1 progress)
# Expected Response:
# - totalQuestions = set1Total
# - practicedQuestions = set1Practiced
# - set1Complete = false
# - Main fields show Set 1 only
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/2/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0102
Accept: application/json

### Scenario 2: Set 1 Complete, Set 2 Not Started
# Expected Response:
# - totalQuestions = set1Total + set2Total
# - practicedQuestions = set1Practiced (set2Practiced = 0)
# - set1Complete = true
# - Main fields show combined totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/3/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0103
Accept: application/json

### Scenario 3: Set 1 Complete, Set 2 In Progress
# Expected Response:
# - totalQuestions = set1Total + set2Total
# - practicedQuestions = set1Practiced + set2Practiced
# - set1Complete = true
# - Main fields show combined totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/4/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0104
Accept: application/json

### Scenario 4: Both Sets Complete
# Expected Response:
# - totalQuestions = set1Total + set2Total
# - practicedQuestions = totalQuestions
# - set1Complete = true
# - notPracticed = 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/5/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0105
Accept: application/json

### Scenario 5: No Questions Available
# Expected Response:
# - All fields = 0
# - set1Complete = false
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=NONEXISTENT
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Test: Invalid Student ID
# Expected: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/99999/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Test: Missing Chapter ID Parameter
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter
Accept: application/json

### Test: Missing Subject ID Parameter
# Expected: 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/subject
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### VERIFICATION TESTS
### ============================================

### Verify Set 1 Breakdown Always Populated
# Check that set1Total, set1Practiced, set1Correct, set1Incorrect are always present
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify Set 2 Breakdown Always Populated
# Check that set2Total, set2Practiced, set2Correct, set2Incorrect are always present
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify set1Complete Flag
# Check that set1Complete is boolean (true/false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### CALCULATION VERIFICATION
### ============================================

### Verify: notPracticed = totalQuestions - practicedQuestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify: set1NotPracticed = set1Total - set1Practiced
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify: set2NotPracticed = set2Total - set2Practiced
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Verify: When set1Complete=false, totalQuestions = set1Total
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/2/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0102
Accept: application/json

### Verify: When set1Complete=true, totalQuestions = set1Total + set2Total
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/3/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId=LC5H0103
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### CROSS-ENDPOINT CONSISTENCY TESTS
### ============================================

### Compare Practice vs Test Progress (Same Student, Same Chapter)
# Both should have same structure but different data
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/testProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

### Compare Chapter vs Subject Progress (Same Student, Same Subject)
# Subject should aggregate all chapters in that subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/chapter?chapterId={{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}/practiceProgress/subject?subjectId={{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

### ============================================
### NOTES FOR MANUAL TESTING
### ============================================

# 1. Set 1 Incomplete Test:
#    - Create a student who has practiced some but not all Set 1 questions
#    - Verify main fields show Set 1 only
#    - Verify set1Complete = false

# 2. Set 1 Complete Test:
#    - Create a student who has practiced all Set 1 questions
#    - Verify main fields show Set 1 + Set 2 combined
#    - Verify set1Complete = true
#    - Verify this works even if Set 2 not started

# 3. Set 2 Progress Test:
#    - After Set 1 complete, practice some Set 2 questions
#    - Verify main fields include Set 2 progress
#    - Verify set2Practiced > 0

# 4. Accuracy Calculation:
#    - Verify correctAnswers + incorrectAnswers = practicedQuestions
#    - Verify set1Correct + set1Incorrect = set1Practiced
#    - Verify set2Correct + set2Incorrect = set2Practiced

# 5. Edge Cases:
#    - Test with 0 questions in Set 1
#    - Test with 0 questions in Set 2
#    - Test with only Set 1 questions (no Set 2)
#    - Test with only Set 2 questions (no Set 1)

### ============================================
